WEBVTT

00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:01.682
iphone-linux mounts

00:00:01.494 --> 00:00:02.602
an iPhone as

00:00:02.414 --> 00:00:03.463
a read /

00:00:03.286 --> 00:00:04.960
write Linux filesystem

00:00:05.478 --> 00:00:06.503
A Show HN

00:00:06.315 --> 00:00:07.588
project that uses

00:00:07.424 --> 00:00:09.204
Xcode's wireless-debugging

00:00:09.016 --> 00:00:10.419
protocol plus FUSE

00:00:10.266 --> 00:00:11.480
to expose iPhone

00:00:11.292 --> 00:00:12.470
storage and app

00:00:12.282 --> 00:00:13.720
Documents folders as

00:00:13.532 --> 00:00:15.053
normal Linux directories

00:00:15.112 --> 00:00:16.303
with no cable

00:00:16.162 --> 00:00:17.317
or Apple account

00:00:17.854 --> 00:00:18.986
It needs Developer

00:00:18.797 --> 00:00:19.823
Mode enabled on

00:00:19.635 --> 00:00:20.424
the iPhone

00:00:20.578 --> 00:00:21.568
the same Wi-Fi

00:00:21.380 --> 00:00:23.054
network and Python

00:00:22.866 --> 00:00:23.537
3 .

00:00:23.349 --> 00:00:24.115
10 +

00:00:24.198 --> 00:00:25.047
it was tested

00:00:24.859 --> 00:00:26.273
on Ubuntu 24

00:00:26.085 --> 00:00:26.604
.

00:00:26.415 --> 00:00:27.653
04 +

00:00:28.190 --> 00:00:29.498
The installer creates

00:00:29.310 --> 00:00:30.454
a Python venv

00:00:30.513 --> 00:00:32.352
installs all dependencies

00:00:32.435 --> 00:00:34.015
and adds iphone-linux

00:00:33.827 --> 00:00:34.640
to your PATH

00:00:35.166 --> 00:00:36.180
Full story on

00:00:35.991 --> 00:00:36.887
the dashboard
